      "code": "# Compute the 12th Fibonacci number (with F1 = 1, F2 = 1)\r\ndef fib(n):\r\n    if n <= 0:\r\n        return 0\r\n    a, b = 1, 1\r\n    if n == 1:\r\n        return a\r\n    for _ in range(2, n+1):\r\n        a, b = b, a + b\r\n    return b\r\n\r\nn = 12\r\nresult = fib(n)\r\nprint(f\"The {n}th Fibonacci number (with F1=1, F2=1) is: {result}\")",
